Successes: On-going Pharmacist engagement implemented through Quality Huddles across patient care areas.","progress2":"Baseline data on Best Possible Medication History (BPMH) completion is required to better understand drivers of medication reconciliation performance on admission and to inform targeted improvement strategies. While Q3 results remain below the 65% target, recent months demonstrate upward trend (61% and 63.6%).

